WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.734
-Good evening, everybody.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.734 --> 00:00:04.200
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.200
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.868
Former President Trump
held a rally

00:00:07.868 --> 00:00:10.334
on Saturday in Waco, Texas,
near the site of

00:00:10.334 --> 00:00:12.400
the Branch Davidian cult's
compound,

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.734
or as it's now known,

00:00:13.734 --> 00:00:15.634
campaign headquarters.

00:00:15.634 --> 00:00:17.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.734 --> 00:00:20.100
Former President Trump
held a campaign rally

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.801
on Saturday in Waco, Texas,

00:00:21.801 --> 00:00:25.767
making him the first cult leader
ever to escape that city alive.

00:00:25.767 --> 00:00:28.434
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.234 --> 00:00:32.901
During his rally on Saturday,
former President Trump

00:00:32.901 --> 00:00:34.767
mocked Florida Governor
Ron DeSantis

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:36.801
and said he has,
"no personality,"

00:00:36.801 --> 00:00:38.634
which based on the past,

00:00:38.634 --> 00:00:40.834
makes him frontrunner for VP.

00:00:40.834 --> 00:00:43.767
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.767 --> 00:00:45.834
During his rally on Saturday
in Texas,

00:00:45.834 --> 00:00:48.033
former President Trump
dismissed claims

00:00:48.033 --> 00:00:51.133
that he had an affair with
adult-film star Stormy Daniels

00:00:51.133 --> 00:00:52.567
and mocked her appearance.

00:00:52.567 --> 00:00:56.934
You're mocking her appearance?

00:00:56.934 --> 00:01:00.834
Remember that picture
of the two of you together?

00:01:00.834 --> 00:01:03.200
This looks like a picture
you'd see on Facebook

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.367
with the caption,
"Last time seeing Grandpa."

00:01:06.367 --> 00:01:09.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.334 --> 00:01:12.067
Russian President --

00:01:12.067 --> 00:01:14.300
Russian President Vladimir Putin
announced over the weekend

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:16.434
that Russia has reached
a deal with Belarus

00:01:16.434 --> 00:01:19.200
to station nuclear weapons
in its territory.

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:21.267
The deal announcement
came as a surprise

00:01:21.267 --> 00:01:23.234
both to NATO and Belarus.

00:01:23.234 --> 00:01:24.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.601 --> 00:01:25.934
[ Eastern European accent ]
"Starting when?"

00:01:25.934 --> 00:01:28.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:30.100
[ Normal voice ] Officials in
Philadelphia announced yesterday

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:32.133
that tap water
is safe to drink

00:01:32.133 --> 00:01:35.100
after a toxic spill
in the Delaware River.

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:37.167
That's right, Philly residents
can drink water,

00:01:37.167 --> 00:01:40.901
but they still
can't pronounce it.

00:01:40.901 --> 00:01:42.734
W-Wooter.

00:01:42.734 --> 00:01:46.267
Okay.
No, go with wooter.

00:01:46.267 --> 00:01:48.267
Officials in California
recently responded

00:01:48.267 --> 00:01:49.734
after a truck overturned

00:01:49.734 --> 00:01:52.501
and spilled a load
of 10,000 empty wine bottles

00:01:52.501 --> 00:01:53.701
onto the road.

00:01:53.701 --> 00:01:55.634
They hadn't seen that many
empty wine bottles

00:01:55.634 --> 00:01:57.801
since week two
of COVID lockdown.

00:01:57.801 --> 00:02:00.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.334 --> 00:02:02.300
An 80-year-old woman in Canada

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:04.367
recently received
the Guinness World Record

00:02:04.367 --> 00:02:05.667
for most blood donated.

00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:08.200
Said the woman, "I'm 26."

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:10.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:15.567
A high school principal
in Florida

00:02:15.567 --> 00:02:17.934
recently resigned
after she received criticism for

00:02:17.934 --> 00:02:20.501
showing students Michelangelo's
sculpture of David,

00:02:20.501 --> 00:02:22.901
which one parent
allegedly called pornographic.

00:02:22.901 --> 00:02:25.300
And I can't believe
I never noticed this before,

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:27.300
but they might have a point.

00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:29.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.901 --> 00:02:34.267
You never notice that part
because...

00:02:34.267 --> 00:02:35.934
you're looking
at the tiny wang.

00:02:35.934 --> 00:02:37.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.601 --> 00:02:41.801
I took art history class.

00:02:41.801 --> 00:02:43.667
That's how I know
what to call it.

00:02:45.968 --> 00:02:47.634
The TSA announced last week

00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:50.267
that it's now classifying
peanut butter as a liquid.

00:02:50.267 --> 00:02:52.934
So bad news -- Now you're
going to have to chug that

00:02:52.934 --> 00:02:54.667
at security, too.

00:02:54.667 --> 00:02:56.667
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.467 --> 00:03:04.868
And, finally,
New York City today

00:03:04.868 --> 00:03:07.634
launched its curbside
composting program,

00:03:07.634 --> 00:03:08.934
or as rats are calling it,

00:03:08.934 --> 00:03:10.167
Restaurant Week.

00:03:10.167 --> 00:03:12.634
[ Laughter ]
And that was the monologue.

